      "writtenOn": "2023-10-04T19:18:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gotcha. So as an example right now there is a btif_get_address_type API in btif_dm.cc that reads from the config: https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/btif/src/btif_dm.cc;l\u003d4045?q\u003dbtif_config_get_int%20%22AddressType%22\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main\n\nYou already added the bt_property_type_t entry for address type here in this CL.\n\nAFAICT you should just be able to call btif_config_get_int in line 401 case instead of using additional storage, and still pipe it up thru bt_interface_t.",
